  <h2>Untitled Section</h2>
  <h3>llGetObjectLinkKey</h3>
  <p><b> <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Functions" target="_blank">Function</a>: <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Key" target="_blank">key</a> </b>llGetObjectLinkKey<b>( <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Key" target="_blank">key</a> object_id, <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Integer" target="_blank">integer</a> link );</b></p>
